== History==
=== Background===
[[Azmuth (Classic)|Azmuth]] worked on the Ultimatrix for years,{{Refn|[[:File:Incomplete Ultimatrix.PNG]]|group = DM}} but its power core was unstable and incomplete, so he contained the device in high-security storage.

===Alien Force===
In ''[[The Final Battle: Part 1]]'', [[Albedo]] stole the Ultimatrix and was able to stabilize the core, as well as "surpassing" the [[Omnitrix (Original)|prototype Omnitrix]] by adding the evolutionary function. Unfortunately for him, [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]]'s DNA was still the default for the Omnitrix and the Ultimatrix was still linked to the same database, so Albedo only had access to Ben's current aliens, which excluded [[Grey Matter (Classic)|Grey Matter]]. Allying himself with [[Vilgax (Classic)|Vilgax]], he agreed to help him so he could turn himself back to normal, while Vilgax could have the [[Earth (Classic)|Earth]]. After Albedo as [[Ultimate Humungousaur|Negative Ultimate Humungousaur]] easily defeated Ben as [[Humungousaur (Classic)|Humungousaur]], Vilgax threatened [[Gwen Tennyson (Classic)|Gwen]] and [[Kevin Levin (Classic)|Kevin]]'s lives in order to force Ben to give up the Omnitrix to him. Afterwards, Vilgax betrayed Albedo by using the Omnitrix to defeat him by turning his army of [[Bioid]]s into thousands of Humungousaurs.

In ''[[The Final Battle: Part 2]]'', Ben activated the Omnitrix's self-destruct mechanism to force Vilgax to remove it but Vilgax refused, thinking he was bluffing and later suffered the consequences. Ben released Albedo and forced him to give him the Ultimatrix via the same threat. Ben used [[Ultimate Swampfire]] to battle Vilgax and used [[Jetray (Classic)|Jetray]] to later escape.

===Ultimate Alien===
At an unknown time during '''[[Ben 10: Ultimate Alien (TV Series)|Ultimate Alien]]''', Kevin would add a security feature to the Ultimatrix, restricting Ben from transforming into [[Alien X (Classic)|Alien X]]. It could be overridden by inserting [[Ultimatrix Security Keys|two keys]] that both Kevin and Gwen carry.

Ben continued to use it until he defeated Vilgax with [[Dagon]]'s powers, Azmuth came to take [[Ascalon]] as well as the Ultimatrix and gave the new [[Omnitrix (Omniverse)|Omnitrix]] to the worthy wielder. Azmuth destroyed the Ultimatrix off-screen after ''[[The Ultimate Enemy: Part 2]]''.{{Refn|name = destroyed|group = DJW}}

