===Evolutionary Function===
[[File:MoI (326).png|thumb]]
*The Ultimatrix had the ability to evolve aliens into their Ultimate Form, granting them more powerful abilities. This was activated by pressing the Ultimatrix symbol as an alien, causing four gray spikes to grow from the dial and the selected alien to transform (often [[Transformation Sequences|stylized]] as green bands of light washing over them).
*The Evolutionary Function worked by placing the selected species in a simulation right down to the DNA, for an extended period of time (about a million years or so) in what is described as a "worst-case scenario";{{Refn|[[:File:Ultimates Worst Case Scenario.PNG]]|group = DM}} the actual DNA is then simply modified to match the new DNA. This survival-of-the-fittest routine explains why the evolutions are more combat-centered than their normal forms.
*Theoretically, almost any DNA can be put through the Evolutionary Function.{{Refn|[[:File:Almost All Aliens Have Ultimates.png]]|group = DJW}}{{Refn|[[:File:Jetray Speed Limit.png]]|group = MW}}

