*The DNA sources of aliens can override the alien and take control of the user's mind, like [[Ampfibian (Classic)|Ampfibian]]<ref name="Fused" /> and [[Ultimate Forms|Ultimates]].<ref name="TUS" />

==Known Aliens==
The Ultimatrix initially had a total of at least 1,000,905 different DNA samples (not counting the Ultimate Forms),<ref>[[Omnitrix (Original)|Omnitrix]]</ref> but throughout the first season of '''[[Ultimate Alien]]''', it scanned the DNA of 5 aliens from the [[Andromeda (Classic)|Andromeda Galaxy]], thus having at least 1,000,910 DNA samples available through the [[Codon Stream]], with 63 aliens unlocked by the time of the episode ''[[The Flame Keepers' Circle]]'', and 46 named aliens (excluding Ultimate forms and transformations with [[Upchuck|repeated names]]). Of the 47 transformations listed, Ben transformed into 35 of them on screen.

