==Trivia==
*[[Albedo]] installed more features in the Ultimatrix than is officially known.{{Refn|[[:File:Ultimatrix Hidden Features.PNG]]|group = DM}}
*Azmuth does not enjoy the Evolutionary Function, and stated it was "begging for trouble".<ref name="MoI" />
**[[Dwayne McDuffie]] had originally planned an episode covering Azmuth's dislike of [[Ultimate Forms]], including something to do with Ben's eyes glowing pink after he reverted to human from [[Ultimate Spidermonkey]] in ''[[Fame]]''.{{Refn|[[:File:Glowing Eyes Episode.PNG]]|group = DM}}{{Refn|[[:File:Ben Pink Eyes.PNG]]|group = DM}}
*The Ultimatrix's mistransformations were not entirely the fault of Albedo's shoddy work.{{Refn|[[:File:Ultimatrix Mistransformations.PNG]]|group = DM}}
*Most of the Ultimatrix aliens were both prime specimens and optimized adults of their respective species{{Refn|[[:File:Prime Specimen Omnitrix.png]]|group = DJW}}{{Refn|[[:File:Omnitrix Aliens are Optimized Adults.png]]|group = MW}} with the exception being [[Alien X (Classic)|Alien X]] because he is a typical representation of [[Celestialsapien (Classic)|his race]].{{Refn|[[:File:Alien X Typical Celestialsapien.PNG]]|group = DM}}
**However, this may not be correct, as the way age affects the transformations has been inconsistently represented throughout the series.
*[[Derrick J. Wyatt]] believed that the Ultimatrix had technical glitches that would cause random flight and abilities not native to the alien species.{{Refn|group = DJW|name = glitches}} However, it is unknown if this is canon as [[Matt Wayne]] seemed to be unaware of the existence of power glitches.{{Refn|http://archive.is/A42xJ|group = MW}}
*Ben scanned aliens off-screen and reordered his list afterwards. Thus, Ben had many more aliens than revealed. However, he didn't scan them at every chance he got.{{Refn|[[:File:Ben Didn't Always Scan.PNG]]|group = ES}} 
*Most of the unseen aliens available in the Ultimatrix were unlocked by [[Ben 10,000 (Ultimate Alien)|Ben 10,000]] because he thought it would annoy Azmuth.<ref name="B10KR" />

